Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.96,0:05:22.41,Title,0,0,0,0,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.34,0:00:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,体温降下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fever's gone down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.90,0:00:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.47,0:00:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.97,0:01:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,索菲亚呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sophia?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.34,0:01:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is she okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.44,0:01:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.27,0:01:09.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她没事 - 好好休息\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's fine. - Rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.87,0:01:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就在这儿 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be right here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.89,0:01:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.98,0:01:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.00,0:01:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.06,0:01:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他能挺过来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll pull through,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.57,0:01:46.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,多亏赫谢尔和他家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks to Hershel and his people.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.49,0:01:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有肖恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Shane.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.77,0:01:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果没有他的话 我们就失去卡尔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd have lost carl if not for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.18,0:01:58.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢天谢地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank god.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.70,0:02:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都很担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were so worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.16,0:02:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 到底发生什么了 - 打猎出了意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How'd it happen? - Hunting accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.40,0:02:08.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这么回事 只是一场愚蠢的意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all… just a stupid accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.23,0:02:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,惟愿上帝保佑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blessed be god,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.72,0:02:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,父神耶稣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father of our lord Jesus Christ.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.02,0:02:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,予其赞美\N{\fnArial\fs30}Praise be to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.66,0:02:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,赐予我们的兄弟 奥蒂斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the gift of our brother Otis,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.41,0:02:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,馈赠其此生之年\N{\fnArial\fs30}for his span of years,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.48,0:02:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,馈赠其高尚品格\N{\fnArial\fs30}for his abundance of character;
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.56,0:02:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥蒂斯 他为了挽救一个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Otis, who gave his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.50,0:02:36.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,付出自己的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}to save a child's,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.09,0:02:39.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,而如今 这是我们最珍贵的财富\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now more than ever, our most precious asset.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.61,0:02:40.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们感谢上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}We thank you, god,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.77,0:02:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿他在您的怀抱里 永享安乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the peace he enjoys in your embrace.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.76,0:02:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他虽死犹生\N{\fnArial\fs30}He died as he lived, in grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.16,0:02:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,肖恩 你愿意为奥蒂斯作悼词吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shane, will you speak for Otis?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.99,0:02:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不太擅长这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not good at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.50,0:02:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.33,0:03:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是最后一个和他在一起的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were the last one with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.24,0:03:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你见证了他的最后时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shared his final moments.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.92,0:03:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.72,0:03:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要听这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.62,0:03:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要知道 他死得其所\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to know his death had meaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.73,0:03:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.56,0:03:21.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时我们快要走投无路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were about done.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.62,0:03:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,子弹几乎用光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost out of ammo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.30,0:03:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,只剩下手枪可用\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were down to pistols by then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.50,0:03:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我腿一瘸一拐 情况很糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was limping. It was bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.82,0:03:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,脚踝也肿的很高\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ankle all swollen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.62,0:03:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我们必须得救那个孩子」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"We've got to save the boy."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.56,0:03:39.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是这么说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, that's what he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.04,0:03:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把背包给了我 将我往前一推\N{\fnArial\fs30}He gave me his backpack. He shoved me ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.40,0:03:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,「快走」 他说\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Run, " He said.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.40,0:03:52.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说「我垫后 掩护你」\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said, "I'll take the rear. I'll cover you."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.91,0:03:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,可当我回过头时…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when I looked back…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.69,0:04:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不是奥蒂斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}If not for Otis,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.44,0:04:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不可能还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd have never made it out alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.78,0:04:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that goes for Carl too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.46,0:04:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,多亏了奥蒂斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was Otis.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.24,0:04:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他救了我们俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}He saved us both.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.56,0:04:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果说谁的死会有意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}If any death ever had meaning,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.46,0:04:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯有他死得其所\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was his.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.56,0:05:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个小女孩失踪多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long has this girl been lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.43,0:05:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天是第三天\N{\fnArial\fs30}This'll be day three.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.38,0:05:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是郡里的测量地图\N{\fnArial\fs30}County survey map.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.19,0:05:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面标有地形和海拔高度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shows terrain and elevations.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.72,0:05:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我们终于可以计划下这件事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is perfect. We can finally get this thing organized.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.56,0:05:37.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,划分区域\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll grid the whole area,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.78,0:05:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,分组展开搜寻工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}start searching in teams.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.80,0:05:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不行 今天不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not you. Not today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.48,0:05:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被抽了一千五百CC的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gave three units of blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.32,0:05:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这种高温下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't be hiking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.09,0:05:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你步行五分钟就得晕过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}five minutes in this heat before passing out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.48,0:05:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你的脚踝 你现在使劲的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your ankle… push it now,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.98,0:05:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,以后就得在床上躺一个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll be laid up a month,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.48,0:05:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,对谁都毫无益处\N{\fnArial\fs30}no good to anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.55,0:05:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,貌似只剩下我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess it's just me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.96,0:05:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我返回到小溪那 从那儿开始找\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna head back to the creek, work my way from there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.74,0:05:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也能发挥点作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can still be useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.73,0:06:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开车去州际公路\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll drive up to the interstate,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.10,0:06:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看索菲亚是不是又走回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}see if Sophia wandered back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.59,0:06:04.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 就明天吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, tomorrow then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.33,0:06:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,到时我们再好好找\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll start doing this right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.99,0:06:08.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么出去的人手里不能就拿把刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}That means we can't have our people out there with just knives.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.99,0:06:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,得训练他们用枪 我们答应过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They need the gun training we've been promising them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.10,0:06:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我的地盘 你们最好别带枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd prefer you not carrying guns on my property.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.85,0:06:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不用枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've managed so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.08,0:06:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,也这么过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}without turning this into an armed camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.04,0:06:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,无意冒犯您\N{\fnArial\fs30}All due respect,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.05,0:06:24.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这附近有成群的行尸游荡…\N{\fnArial\fs30}you get a crowd of those things wandering in here…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.85,0:06:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我们在这里是客\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we're guests here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.78,0:06:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的地盘\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your property.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.73,0:06:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会尊重这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we will respect that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.21,0:06:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先要做的是 设营地 找到索菲亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}First things first: Set camp, find Sophia.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.26,0:06:47.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想多问 但有个问题必须先说好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate to be the one to ask, but somebody's got to.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.75,0:06:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果找她后发现她被咬了 该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happens if we find her and she's bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.98,0:06:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都该清楚到时怎么处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we should all be clear on how we handle that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.78,0:06:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,该怎么做就怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do what has to be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.94,0:06:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,那她妈妈呢 怎么告诉她\N{\fnArial\fs30}And her mother? What do you tell her?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.64,0:06:59.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉她事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}The truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.37,0:07:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会收来所有武器 集中保存\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll gather and secure all the weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.21,0:07:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,在找到靶场练习前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make sure no one's carrying.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.55,0:07:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要让其他人持枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}till we're at a practice range off site.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.90,0:07:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我要求有一个人拿着枪巡逻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do request one rifleman on lookout.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.32,0:07:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴尔是个老手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dale's got experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.14,0:07:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少留一把枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our people would feel safer,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.33,0:07:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样我们的人会觉得更安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}less inclined to carry a gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.08,0:07:22.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.17,0:07:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们带来的药品\N{\fnArial\fs30}That stuff you brought,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.28,0:07:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有抗生素 绷带之类的剩下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}got more antibiotics, bandages, anything like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.03,0:07:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,就只有你看到的那些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just what you've seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.62,0:07:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经快要用光了 我得去城里一趟\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're running short already. I should make a run into town.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.95,0:07:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是肖恩去过的那地方吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not the place Shane went?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.15,0:07:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 几英里外有个药房\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, there's a pharmacy just a mile down the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.75,0:07:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之前也去过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've done it before.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.42,0:07:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到那个戴着棒球帽的人了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}See our man there in the baseball cap?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.56,0:07:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他叫格伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Glenn,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.26,0:07:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我们的活地图\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our go-to-town expert.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.85,0:07:51.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他跟你一起去 以防万一\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd ask him along just to be cautious.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.59,0:08:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说他醒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear he woke up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.76,0:08:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 他时昏时醒 不过总算醒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. He's in and out, but yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.52,0:08:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会好起来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.84,0:08:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.10,0:08:20.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说真心说的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you mean it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.21,0:08:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.23,0:08:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说让我留下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.37,0:08:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是真心那么说吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you mean it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.77,0:08:30.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 如果你不是随口说说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, if you didn't just say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.64,0:08:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就告诉我 我要知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}But do it now. I need to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.70,0:08:37.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是认真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I meant it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.78,0:08:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.53,0:09:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说你跑得很快 来去自如\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear you're fast on your feet and know how to get in and out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.97,0:09:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得去趟药房 一起不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got a pharmacy run. You in?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.95,0:09:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,小姐 这里怎么取水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss, what's the water situation here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.44,0:09:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,有五口井\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got five wells on our land.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.35,0:09:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,饮用水直接从一号井里取\N{\fnArial\fs30}House draws directly from number one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.67,0:09:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,二号井就在那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Number-two well is right over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.04,0:09:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是给牲口喝的 但是一样很干净\N{\fnArial\fs30}We use it for the cattle but it's just as pure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.35,0:09:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便用 房子后面的发电棚里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take what you need. There's a cart and containers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.16,0:09:23.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,有马车和水桶\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the generator shed behind the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.05,0:09:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我帮你给马备鞍\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go saddle your horse then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.66,0:09:29.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,马\N{\fnArial\fs30}Horse?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.07,0:09:35.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我们的枪交出去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give up our guns?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.14,0:09:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听见瑞克的话了 我们是客人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard Rick. We're guests here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.10,0:09:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样你都没意见吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're okay with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.26,0:09:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人征求我的意见 现在把枪放下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't recall being asked. Now lay down your weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.80,0:09:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你喜欢在地上滚来滚去 但我不喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may like rolling over, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.29,0:09:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我反正是也得换洗衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I have to strip and clean them anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.85,0:09:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还要不要学\N{\fnArial\fs30}You still want to learn?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.38,0:09:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶紧的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.51,0:09:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.13,0:09:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.06,0:09:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,把子弹卸下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unload your weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.72,0:10:03.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,检查一下弹膛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check the chamber.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.79,0:10:04.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,往外拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.00,0:10:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那个杆推出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Push that lever out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.37,0:10:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后它就会自动就滑下\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll slide off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.59,0:10:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,成功一半了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're halfway there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.51,0:10:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.52,0:10:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay on your own?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.38,0:10:31.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己更好 天黑前我就回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm better on my own. I'll be back before dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.09,0:10:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在有了落脚点\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a base.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.01,0:10:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以妥善地制定搜索计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can get this search properly organized now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.93,0:10:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是要聊天还是谈正经事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a point or are we just chatting?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.50,0:10:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是不想你有危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}My point is it lets you off the hook.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.38,0:10:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不欠我们什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't owe us anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.65,0:10:49.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的其他计划反正也都泡汤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My other plans fell through.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.90,0:11:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以给你们腾出点地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could give you more space.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.79,0:11:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,在谷仓那边搭帐篷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Set up over by the barn.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.74,0:11:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不需要那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no need for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.26,0:11:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们离房子近点更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better you stay close to the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.04,0:11:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这话不太好说出口 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't say this easily, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.40,0:11:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一般都不接纳陌生人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't normally take in strangers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.90,0:11:15.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想你们以为这是久留之地\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't have your people thinking this is permanent.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.25,0:11:19.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦你们找到那个女孩 你儿子身体恢复\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once you find this girl and your boy's fit for travel,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.94,0:11:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你们可以离开这\N{\fnArial\fs30}I expect you'll move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.53,0:11:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这点我们要说清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to be clear on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.11,0:11:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好呀 农场主女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, farmer's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.56,0:11:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是药品清单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. Here's your list.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.55,0:11:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, um,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.65,0:11:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有另外一种东西 我分开写了\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's one other item. I wrote it down separately.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.13,0:12:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个人需要 小心别说出去 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's personal. If we could be real discreet about that, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.20,0:12:03.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.52,0:12:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.18,0:12:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.95,0:12:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,忘了要说话小心吗 格伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of missing the point of the whole discreet thing, Glenn.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.07,0:12:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, right. Um…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.08,0:12:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是我得知道在哪找得到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just need to know where to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.83,0:12:21.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看女性卫生用品区有没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try the feminine hygiene section.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.23,0:12:23.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 不用多说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Enough said.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.09,0:12:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Consider it done.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.18,0:12:34.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不弱 也不是懦夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not weak and I'm not a coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.45,0:12:35.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没说过你是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never said you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.71,0:12:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我在高速上说的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, what I said on the highway…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.42,0:12:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道说的话什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what that was,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.62,0:12:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者为什么要那么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}where it came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.48,0:12:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是真实的我\N{\fnArial\fs30}That wasn't me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.95,0:12:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果可以的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it's okay, I'd rather you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.29,0:12:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能不能别把我的话告诉其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}never told anybody about that stuff I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.09,0:12:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么话\N{\fnArial\fs30}What stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.61,0:12:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一整天都没听到你说一个字\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't get a word out of you all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.53,0:13:06.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄 你说我们会有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say, man, you think there's a snowball's chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.47,0:13:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的找到那个小女孩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll actually find that little girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.75,0:13:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,人生中第一次 我赌有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the first time in my life I'm betting on the snowball.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.57,0:13:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.04,0:13:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.28,0:13:17.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我们做什么都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do whatever we have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.39,0:13:21.85,Title,0,0,0,0,,我不在乎是否要像蓝博（《第一滴血》主角）那样搜寻树林\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care if I have to comb the woods like Rambo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.97,0:13:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是过来取水\N{\fnArial\fs30}or fetch a pail of water.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.16,0:13:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都各司其职 各行其事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone kicks in, does their part.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.82,0:13:28.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.61,0:13:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,做好自己那部分 不怨天尤人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do your part, don't complain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.45,0:13:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我经常\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I always…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.57,0:13:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要是你就不会喝这水\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't drink that if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.09,0:13:59.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我们遇到了位游泳健将\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like we've got us a swimmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.62,0:14:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得它在下面待多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long you think it's been there?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.75,0:14:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,久到估计都能长出腮来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long enough to grow gills.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.20,0:14:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能让它呆在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't leave it in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.28,0:14:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,天知道它有没有污染井水\N{\fnArial\fs30}God knows what it's doing to the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.87,0:14:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得把它弄出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to get it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.59,0:14:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,简单 给他脑袋来一枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy. Put a bullet in its head.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.87,0:14:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去拿绳子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get a rope.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.09,0:14:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa whoa, guys. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.55,0:14:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不行 这是个好计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not? It's a good plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.41,0:14:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个愚蠢的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a stupid plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.17,0:14:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这个行尸还没有污染井水\N{\fnArial\fs30}If that thing hasn't contaminated the water yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.02,0:14:28.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它脑浆打出来正好帮了倒忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}blowing its brains out will finish the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.60,0:14:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说得对 我们不能冒这个险\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's right. Can't risk it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.68,0:14:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那它必须活着出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it has to come out alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.29,0:14:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}So to speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.58,0:14:36.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.25,0:14:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们抛锚时所在的公路在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}The interstate where you broke down is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.93,0:14:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是那条小溪\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's your creek.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.58,0:14:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的农场在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}My farm is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.00,0:14:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在面向这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're looking out that way,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.81,0:14:51.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,东南偏南方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}south-southeast.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.32,0:14:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,小溪的这个支流一带我们完全没去找过\N{\fnArial\fs30}We missed this branch of the creek entirely.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.90,0:14:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果她往那个方向跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If she went that direction,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.97,0:14:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就和我们搜寻的地方差出好几里地\N{\fnArial\fs30}she'd be miles from where we looked.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.34,0:15:00.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克 休息一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick, take a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.60,0:15:01.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come look.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.89,0:15:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,很美 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's something, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.37,0:15:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,偶尔停下来想一想很不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good to pause for an occasional reminder.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.08,0:15:19.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,想什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.78,0:15:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便想点什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever comes to mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.70,0:15:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一般都在想上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}For me it's often god.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.37,0:15:26.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不信奉上帝吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No thoughts on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.82,0:15:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,上次我向上帝祈求帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last time I asked god for a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.90,0:15:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后停下来欣赏风景的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}and stopped to admire a view.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.52,0:15:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我儿子中了枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}My son got shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.52,0:15:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想再和那位万能上帝有任何关系了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I try not to mix it up with the Almighty anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.09,0:15:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好互相不打扰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Best we stay out of each other's way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.21,0:15:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛莉给我讲了你的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lori told me your story…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.12,0:15:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么中了枪 在医院昏迷\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you were shot, the coma.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.28,0:15:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不管怎样你逃了出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet you came out of it somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.17,0:15:49.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有感觉是上帝在帮你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did not feel god's hand in yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.17,0:15:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那一刻吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}At that moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.59,0:15:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I did not.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.51,0:15:59.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,一片混乱中你找到了妻儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}In all the chaos you found your wife and boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.29,0:16:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来你儿子中枪也活了下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then he was shot and he survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.28,0:16:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也没说明什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That tells you nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.88,0:16:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这说明上帝的幽默感很奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}It tells me god's got a strange sense of humor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.82,0:16:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,它好像没兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not going for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.40,0:16:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概因为罐头肉在被吃的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe 'cause a canned ham don't kick and scream.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.27,0:16:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会又踢又叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you try to eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.83,0:16:37.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说得对 所以行尸不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's right. There's a reason the dead didn't come back to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.05,0:16:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,袭击我们的食橱\N{\fnArial\fs30}and start raiding our cupboards.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.27,0:16:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要活人做诱饵\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need live bait.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.76,0:16:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过我喜欢你的新发型吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have I mentioned that I really like your new haircut?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.23,0:16:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你头真有型\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a nice shaped head.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.44,0:16:56.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 老弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry about it, bud.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.23,0:16:58.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会把你整个拉出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna get you out of here in one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.07,0:17:01.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,得是活着的一整个 重点是「活着」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Living piece. That living part is important.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.33,0:17:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拜托你们慢点放 - 没事啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nice and slow, please. - We got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.26,0:17:10.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这群人疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you people are crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.74,0:17:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底想不想把它从你的井里弄出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to get it out of your well or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.66,0:17:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我们在这儿看着 玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give us an eye there, Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.85,0:17:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doing okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.78,0:17:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yup, doing great.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.02,0:17:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,像在做梦一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Living the dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.94,0:17:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,再放低点 再低点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little lower. Little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.44,0:18:04.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抓住 抓住 - 快抓住\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get it! Get it! - Grab it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.00,0:18:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.67,0:18:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉我出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.49,0:18:12.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉我出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.53,0:18:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,别碰我 别碰我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get it off. Get off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.01,0:18:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,别碰我 拉我出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off! Get me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.54,0:18:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my god. Oh my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.28,0:18:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 拉我出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, get me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.69,0:18:27.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 加油 伙计们 - 拉我出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, you guys. - Get me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.65,0:18:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 天啊 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh god. Oh god. Oh my god!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.58,0:18:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我从这拉出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.65,0:18:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拉啊 - 快拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Pull! - Pull! Pull!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.64,0:18:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拉啊 拉啊 - 加油 用力拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Pull! Pull! - Let's go, pull.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.79,0:18:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我拉出去 把我拉出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me out. Get me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.86,0:18:50.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.84,0:18:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 格伦 - 拉他上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Glenn! - Pull him up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.13,0:18:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉他上来 拉他上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull him up! Pull him up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.24,0:18:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把拉出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.52,0:19:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉他上来 拉他上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull him up. Pull him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.76,0:19:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.36,0:19:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,得重新来过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back to the drawing board.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.67,0:19:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,说得轻巧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Says you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.50,0:21:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,索菲亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sophia!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.12,0:21:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,索菲亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sophia!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.65,0:22:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 加油伙计们 拉啊 - 加油\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, guys, pull. - Come on, y'all.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.17,0:22:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,快好了 加油拉 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost there. Come on, pull, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.77,0:22:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 加油 - 用力啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. - Pull!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.11,0:22:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油 大家一起用力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, y'all. Together.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.11,0:22:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,快好了 加油 继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost there. Come on, pull. Keep it coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.25,0:22:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油 小心点 T仔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, pull. Watch out, dawg.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.05,0:22:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢点 再来一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice and easy. Just a little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.01,0:22:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油 快出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.90,0:22:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油拉啊 兄弟们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got to pull it, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.51,0:22:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡住了 加油\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's stuck! Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.27,0:22:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, pull!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.68,0:22:37.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,用力\N{\fnArial\fs30}pull!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.41,0:23:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得封了这口井\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should seal off this well.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.00,0:23:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个不错的主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, might be a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.64,0:23:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那怎么处理…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what do we do about…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.56,0:23:20.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,还好我们没犯傻拿枪崩了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good thing we didn't do anything stupid like shoot it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.82,0:23:44.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天我们还会回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll come again tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.71,0:23:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道还有机会…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know there's always the chance…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.26,0:23:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,别 我不需要再听这样的话 安德莉亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't. I really don't need to hear it anymore, Andrea.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.12,0:23:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再想也别再祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save the thoughts and prayers.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.72,0:24:03.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,世事难料 卡萝尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never know, Carol.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.00,0:24:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以沿着围栏挂把子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can hang targets along that fence line there.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.02,0:24:22.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,后面的斜坡 是天然挡弹墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}That rise, it gives a natural backstop.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.92,0:24:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个好主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.62,0:24:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.43,0:24:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要多久才能正式拿枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how long before I can carry?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.71,0:24:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,别高估自己的实力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's not get ahead of ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.79,0:24:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最近可不那么有耐性 肖恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not in a very patient frame of mind these days, Shane.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.43,0:24:36.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你应该注意到了 - 得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You might have notice that. - No shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.33,0:24:39.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不担心你会自我了断\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I ain't worried about you offing yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.48,0:24:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然最近你把戴尔老头吓得半死\N{\fnArial\fs30}even though you got old Dale pissing his pants lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.36,0:24:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 这我也注意到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I noticed that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.94,0:24:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是会因为我而\N{\fnArial\fs30}He did come within a minute or so of being blown to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.64,0:24:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,过度紧张 是没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}because of me, to be fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.79,0:24:56.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我看出来你很有拿枪的欲望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I see you have the desire for gun work.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.21,0:24:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这欲望能让你支撑下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}and desire will take you a long way.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.62,0:25:00.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你也要注意开枪要小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}But something you need to know, so fire this carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.56,0:25:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我听着呢 - 纸靶子是一回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm listening. - Paper targets is one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.22,0:25:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,射中不会动的物体很容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy to hit what ain't moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.74,0:25:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是要搞定一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}But taking down an assailant,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.82,0:25:09.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,要杀你的行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}one that's trying to kill you,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.74,0:25:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,是另一回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's different.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.14,0:25:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 在这种情况下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cuz I say, that kind of situation,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.95,0:25:20.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们如果动作很慢 就没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}things slow down. That's crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.07,0:25:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果行动迅速 就靠你的肾上腺素了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They speed up. Adrenalin, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.12,0:25:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你反应慢它就会废了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll cripple you if you let it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.00,0:25:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得利用自己的本能反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to use your instinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.06,0:25:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能给它机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to rule it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.53,0:25:31.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,总得有一个要死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because somebody is going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.75,0:25:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,得想办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you'd better hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.40,0:25:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,由你自己来决定谁死谁活\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you're the one who's making that decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.41,0:25:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么做 我是说 你是怎么做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How? I mean, how do you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.03,0:25:41.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,关掉开关\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn off a switch.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.84,0:25:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这开关\N{\fnArial\fs30}The switch,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.23,0:25:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你感到害怕和愤怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}the one that makes you scared or angry,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.10,0:25:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有同情心什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sympathetic, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.33,0:25:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会想 只会做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't think. You just… you act.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.50,0:25:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为可能有人正指望着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause odds are somebody else is counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.02,0:26:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如你的搭档\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's your partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.14,0:26:03.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.94,0:26:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀人一点都不容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}There ain't nothing easy about taking a man's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.02,0:26:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管该不该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}no matter how little value it may have.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.75,0:26:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你做完这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}But when you get it done,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.44,0:26:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,就必须忘记\N{\fnArial\fs30}you have to forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.38,0:26:25.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我还没达到能遗忘这一步\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I haven't quite got that last part down yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.51,0:26:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're getting there?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.26,0:26:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,但愿如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.52,0:26:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个地方不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a good spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.32,0:26:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这里吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.30,0:26:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 通常\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, normally.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.32,0:26:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我一个人做这种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the kind of thing I'd do on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.65,0:26:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,独行侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Solo.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.87,0:26:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我擅长做的事 明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's sort of my thing, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.57,0:26:59.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是孤家寡人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a loner.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.36,0:27:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧 - 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You all right? - I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.38,0:27:12.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,在井边时我看到你的表情了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw the look on your face back at the well.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.65,0:27:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,从没如此近距离见过有人被杀吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never seen one killed up close before?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.23,0:27:19.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,吓到了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess it's kind of a shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.22,0:27:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 一路上我们看过很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, being out on the road, we've seen a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.19,0:27:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能我们已经有点麻木了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess we've gotten a little numb to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.70,0:27:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa. I guess so…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.71,0:27:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去看看剩下了哪种抗生素\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go see what antibiotics are left.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.84,0:27:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,清单上还有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else is on the list?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.92,0:27:59.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you get started?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.20,0:28:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.10,0:28:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去看看有什么值得拿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna look around, see what's worth grabbing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.34,0:28:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,平常用的一些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just some general stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.97,0:28:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找到什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.24,0:28:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么 正如我说的 平常东西而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing. Just, like I said, general stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.49,0:28:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全套\N{\fnArial\fs30}Condoms?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.76,0:28:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有个我认识的女朋友？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a girlfriend I don't know about?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.64,0:28:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我吗 没 没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me? No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.21,0:28:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你很自信嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you're a pretty confident guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.69,0:29:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.17,0:29:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 我没\N{\fnArial\fs30}No no no. I-I-I wasn't…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.02,0:29:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我绝不会 - 我有什么不好的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I would never… - Something wrong with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.81,0:29:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,没\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.67,0:29:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.49,0:29:14.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会和你那啥…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would never have sex…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.67,0:29:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 我凌乱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, I'm… I'm lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.76,0:29:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会和你做爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have sex with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.70,0:29:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.52,0:29:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.84,0:29:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是十万个为什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're asking questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.04,0:29:33.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我忍不住想问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I can't help wondering.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.93,0:29:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这年头也没什么选择余地了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not like our options are vast these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.59,0:30:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且不是只有你一个人感到孤独\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're not the only one that's lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.55,0:30:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得再考虑下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to reconsider.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.29,0:30:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I beg your pardon?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.12,0:30:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶我们走的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Asking us to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.23,0:31:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得再考虑考虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to reconsider.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.53,0:31:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你见过外面的情况 你就不会赶我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you saw how it is out there you wouldn't ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.60,0:31:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个有信仰的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a man of belief.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.06,0:31:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你真有信仰 就相信我的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you believe anything, believe that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.18,0:31:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让我很为难\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're putting me on the spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.65,0:31:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I mean to.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.90,0:31:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些人有事都找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those people look to me for answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.37,0:31:20.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望他们不要 可还是如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish they didn't, but they do.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.83,0:31:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是为了他们或自己来求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm not asking for them or myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.13,0:31:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是为了我儿子求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm asking for my boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.92,0:31:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你朋友奥蒂斯已经付出了性命\N{\fnArial\fs30}After the price your friend Otis paid,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.22,0:31:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少你再想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}the least you can do is give it some thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.41,0:31:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这人说话真实在\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a plainspoken man.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.93,0:31:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个当爹的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a father.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.91,0:31:38.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想辜负我儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the one thing I don't want to fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.33,0:31:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得自己每天都在辜负他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel like I do every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.80,0:31:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天早上我对他撒了谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lied to him this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.41,0:31:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然不是大谎 但已经够糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't a big lie, but it was enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.48,0:31:58.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我老爸都懒得说谎安慰我\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father didn't bother with comforting lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.89,0:32:00.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他直接动拳头\N{\fnArial\fs30}He used his fist.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.74,0:32:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个毫无爱心 野蛮暴力的酒鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a loveless, violent drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.87,0:32:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,对谁都是个祸害\N{\fnArial\fs30}And no good to anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.49,0:32:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我十五岁时 他把我赶出家门\N{\fnArial\fs30}He drove me from home when I was 15.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.54,0:32:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我离家多年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't lay eyes on this place again for many years.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.11,0:32:14.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克 他死的时候我都不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was not at his deathbed, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.64,0:32:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让他得逞\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would not grant him that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.66,0:32:19.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,至今我也不会后悔\N{\fnArial\fs30}And to this day do not regret it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.23,0:32:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,有的父亲注定得不到儿子的爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some men do not earn the love of their sons.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.39,0:32:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看你应该没这烦恼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't see you having that problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.16,0:32:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会考虑我的请求吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you consider my request?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.16,0:32:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are aspects to this,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.43,0:32:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是不能 也不会商量的\N{\fnArial\fs30}things that I can't and won't discuss.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.72,0:32:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果你和你的人按我的规矩来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you and your people respect my rules,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.42,0:32:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不敢打包票 但我会考虑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}no promises, but I will consider it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.98,0:32:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向你保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have my word.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.73,0:33:03.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.23,0:33:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.61,0:33:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我陪他坐会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll sit with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.56,0:33:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚你不在的时候他醒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was awake earlier when you were gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.62,0:33:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他问你去了哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}He asked for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.09,0:33:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我… - 别煞风景\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I… - Don't spoil it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.98,0:33:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说 感觉不错嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it was good.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.77,0:33:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,仅此一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a one-time thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.74,0:34:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一切都好吗 - 挺好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Everything go okay? - Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.91,0:34:04.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.71,0:34:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you find it?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.61,0:34:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我清理了一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cleaned up.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.37,0:34:54.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,想给她个好环境\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wanted it to be nice for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.79,0:34:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为走错地方了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a second I thought I was in the wrong place.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.00,0:35:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,花\N{\fnArial\fs30}A flower?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.10,0:35:11.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是彻罗基玫瑰\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a cherokee rose.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.30,0:35:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,相传当年美国士兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}The story is that when american soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.37,0:35:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,驱逐印第安人哭着离开他们的家园时\N{\fnArial\fs30}were moving Indians off their land on the trail of tears,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.46,0:35:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,彻罗基族的母亲们以泪洗面\N{\fnArial\fs30}the cherokee mothers were grieving and crying so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.93,0:35:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为她们在途中失去了自己的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause they were losing their little ones along the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.17,0:35:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为日晒雨淋 疾病肆虐\N{\fnArial\fs30}from exposure and disease,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.54,0:35:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有饥饿困乏\N{\fnArial\fs30}and starvation.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.47,0:35:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,许多人失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of them just disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.38,0:35:43.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以长老们 即所谓「祈祷者」\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the elders, they said a prayer;
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.11,0:35:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,祈求神灵鼓舞母亲们的精神\N{\fnArial\fs30}asked for a sign to uplift the mothers' spirits,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.72,0:35:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,给她们力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}give them strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.77,0:35:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}and hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.18,0:35:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二天 这玫瑰\N{\fnArial\fs30}The next day this rose.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.28,0:36:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在妈妈们留下泪水的地方绽放开来\N{\fnArial\fs30}started to grow right where the mothers' tears fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.42,0:36:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没傻到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not fool enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.60,0:36:09.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信有花会为我哥哥而开\N{\fnArial\fs30}to think there's any flowers blooming for my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.61,0:36:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我相信这一朵\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I believe this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.17,0:36:19.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是为你女儿开放的\N{\fnArial\fs30}bloomed for your little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.90,0:36:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,她一定会很喜欢把花放这\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's gonna really like it in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.83,0:36:56.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.97,0:37:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.24,0:37:15.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前我跟你说过苏菲亚的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you something earlier today about Sophia…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.62,0:37:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道了 妈妈告诉我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. Mom told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.72,0:37:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还准备好认错的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here I was getting ready to confess.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.44,0:37:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是故意撒谎 我只是不想你担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't mean to lie. I just didn't want to worry you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.51,0:37:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这借口很傻\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a stupid excuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.81,0:37:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我只想到这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's all I got.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.81,0:37:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.69,0:37:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我们会找到她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think we'll find her?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.08,0:37:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我们会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know we will.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.59,0:37:44.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.90,0:37:49.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.31,0:37:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我真的相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I truly believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.53,0:37:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来很累\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.30,0:38:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是确实很累\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.35,0:38:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我像你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I'm like you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.13,0:38:06.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我俩都挨了子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've both been shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.25,0:38:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不诡异吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't that weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.66,0:38:12.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我想你妈妈会更想听你说「我俩眼睛很像」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I think your mother would rather hear we got the same eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.54,0:38:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以就我们俩说说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let's keep that between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.45,0:38:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然你也加入了挂彩一族\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since you're in the club now,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.10,0:38:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得戴上这帽子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get to wear the hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.61,0:38:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.03,0:38:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天我们往帽檐里塞点东西 就能戴稳当了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll pad the rim tomorrow so it sits better.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.77,0:38:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会想它吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Won't you miss it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.38,0:38:43.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许偶尔你得借我戴会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you'll let me borrow it from time to time.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.61,0:38:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以共享\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can share it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.12,0:38:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.30,0:38:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,睡吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sleep now.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.75,0:38:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.92,0:38:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you, dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.48,0:38:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.93,0:40:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真要把它们丢下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you putting them away?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.91,0:40:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你多陪他一会儿吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay with him a while longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.17,0:40:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会等着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll wait up.
